{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54114","headline":"东都望幸赓歌（题拟） · 李庾","name":"东都望幸赓歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓云行兮西风，庆摇裔兮龙在中。\n望云光兮拜千百，西泽霈兮均东泽。\n（见《文苑英华》卷四四《东都赋》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李庾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}